WEBVTT

13:00.806 --> 13:05.144
The breath of the greatest dragon
forged the Iron Throne,

13:05.269 --> 13:08.147
which the Usurper is
keeping warm for me.

13:09.190 --> 13:12.234
The swords of the vanquished,

13:12.360 --> 13:14.487
a thousand of them...

13:14.612 --> 13:18.949
melted together
like so many candles.

13:22.411 --> 13:26.040
I have always wanted
to see a dragon.

13:26.165 --> 13:29.668
There's nothing in the world
that I would rather see.

13:29.794 --> 13:32.338
Really. Why dragons?
